      is circular but works the same way.","colorTheme":"Blue","guid":"bd0af0bd-5395-4f43-aec7-2da502dbdb5f","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-5539.0,"yMin":1158.0,"xMax":-5361.333,"yMax":1295.0},"title":"Dash","body":"First,
      check the player can dash. Make sure they are pushing the button, they haven''t
      dashed the maximum number of times, and they aren''t already dashing.","colorTheme":"Teal","guid":"59c87fab-90d2-45ae-a177-6b4632295162","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-8469.0,"yMin":653.0,"xMax":-8373.0,"yMax":717.0},"title":"Initialise","body":"seconds","colorTheme":"Green","guid":"d23a4d22-8673-4820-bc87-dd6ceece40b4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-9690.0,"yMin":2937.0,"xMax":-9506.0,"yMax":3001.0},"title":"Sticky
